        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_99233f9336664ff5aa1a3251118e4762",
      "statement": "The Anthropic pipeline writes a bare JSON array of model objects (not the `{generated_at, schema_version, models}` wrapper used by OpenRouter lists) to `anthropic-models.json`, and appends a compact JSONL run entry to `history/anthropic-models.jsonl`; on any `PricingError` neither file is written or modified.",
